00:02:58.373 --> 00:03:01.410
So just to kick off the first question,

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:07.402
what is the LGBTQ community like at the
GSB and what about the campus at large?

00:03:07.402 --> 00:03:09.933
And what kinds of support involvement and

00:03:09.933 --> 00:03:14.428
interaction does the rest of the class
have with the GSB Pride Community.

00:03:14.428 --> 00:03:16.775
So Jack and Vince,
do you want to kick that one off?

00:03:16.775 --> 00:03:17.953
&gt;&gt; Sure.

00:03:17.953 --> 00:03:18.617
&gt;&gt; Jack, go ahead.

00:03:18.617 --> 00:03:23.198
&gt;&gt; Yeah, so I think the community of
the GSB has been fantastic, and for

00:03:23.198 --> 00:03:28.334
me personally, it's the first time
I've really engaged in the community,

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.793
and didn't really prior to school.

00:03:30.793 --> 00:03:34.993
And so for me it's been really warm,
really welcoming, very friendly.

00:03:34.993 --> 00:03:39.995
I think what's nice is the relationship
between the NBA one class and the NBA two

00:03:39.995 --> 00:03:45.016
class kind of turning up on campus and
having some funny faces to the community.

00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:50.280
And also think kind of allyship that
you see in the class more probably.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:54.784
&gt;&gt; Yeah definitely, I would like to stress
on the allyship because having grown up in

00:03:54.784 --> 00:03:58.850
